    "Share load between wrist and forearm muscles by strengthening the forearm and kinetic chain (clinical).",
    "Respond early to swelling or crepitus over the dorsoradial forearm, because early offloading is the first step in treatment [r6].",
    "In climbers, review ice-axe grip and technique if wrist swelling or crepitus appears [r3]."
